  "plain": "Michels suggests that the Pentagon's UFO investigation office of the 2020s, known as AARO, was probably a fake hit job on UFOs, an effort to explain them away. He points to its head, Sean Kirkpatrick, who he says has long ties to the Department of Energy, the US agency that runs the nation's nuclear weapons labs, and who worked at Oak Ridge, one of those government labs. Michels says this himself, without naming a source, as a reason to distrust the office's findings."
